# .plant -- simulated plant for sim_closed_loop.st
#
# columns: channel dir kind gain offset min max init drive
#
# Values are raw counts on a 0..1000 range; the IOMAP carries identity
# scale/bias, so raw == engineering value here and every number below is
# what the ST program sees.

# controlled quantity: first-order lag chasing the actuator, time constant
# of 8 cycles (gain = 1/8 is exactly representable, so the timeline is
# bit-for-bit reproducible)
0 INPUT LAG 0.125 0 0 1000 0 1

# actuator: records whatever the controller writes, no dynamics of its own
1 OUTPUT ACTUATOR 0 0 0 1000 0 -1

# setpoint: constant source, never driven
2 INPUT CONST 0 0 0 1000 500 -1
